{title: Can't Take My Eyes Off You}
{artist: Frankie Valli}
{key: D}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]You're just too good to be true
Can't take my [Dmaj7]eyes off you
You'd be like [D7sus4]heaven to touch
I wanna [G]hold you so much
At long last [Gm]love has arrived
And I thank [D]God I'm alive
You're just too [E]good to be true[Em]
Can't take my [D]eyes off you
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Pardon the [D]way that I stare
There's nothing [Dmaj7]else to compare
The sight of [D7sus4]you leaves me weak
There are no words [G]left to speak
So if you [Gm]feel like I feel
Please let me [D]know that it's real
You're just too [E]good to be true[Em]
Can't take my [D]eyes off of you
{end_of_verse}

